WEBVTT

00:03:57.807 --> 00:04:00.751
Well, they have an extensive toolbox.

00:04:01.982 --> 00:04:06.668
Cancer drugs without nanoparticles
are quickly washed out of the body

00:04:06.692 --> 00:04:07.857
through the kidneys

00:04:07.881 --> 00:04:09.826
because they're so small.

00:04:09.850 --> 00:04:12.002
So it's like water going through a sieve.

00:04:12.628 --> 00:04:15.770
And so they don't really have time
to reach the tumor.

00:04:15.794 --> 00:04:18.022
Here we see an illustration of this.

00:04:18.046 --> 00:04:20.252
We have the firefighters,
the cancer drugs.

00:04:20.276 --> 00:04:22.387
They're circulating in the blood,

00:04:22.411 --> 00:04:24.434
but they're quickly
washed out of the body

00:04:24.458 --> 00:04:27.592
and they don't really end up
inside the tumor.

00:04:28.450 --> 00:04:33.077
But if we put these cancer drugs
inside nanoparticles,